# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Accordion>\n"
"    <AccordionItem title=\"**Click to learn more.**\">\n"
"    ### Overview\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Accordion>\n"
"    <AccordionItem title=\"**לחץ כדי ללמוד עוד.**\">\n"
"    ### סקירה כללית\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    The `NoiseLearner` class performs experiments that characterize noise processes based on a Pauli-Lindblad noise model for one (or more) circuits. It possesses a `run()` method that executes the learning experiments and takes as input either a list of circuits or a [PUB](/guides/primitive-input-output), and returns a `NoiseLearnerResult` containing the learned noise channels and metadata about the submitted jobs. Below is a code snippet demonstrating the usage of the helper program.\n"
msgstr "    מחלקת `NoiseLearner` מבצעת ניסויים המאפיינים תהליכי רעש המבוססים על מודל רעש Pauli-Lindblad עבור Circuit אחד או יותר. יש לה שיטה `run()` המבצעת את ניסויי הלמידה ומקבלת כקלט רשימה של Circuits או [PUB](/guides/primitive-input-output), ומחזירה `NoiseLearnerResult` המכיל את ערוצי הרעש שנלמדו ומטא-נתונים על העבודות שנשלחו. להלן קטע קוד המדגים את השימוש בתוכנית העזר.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python noexec\n"
"    from qiskit import QuantumCircuit\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import CouplingMap\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService, EstimatorV2\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime.noise_learner import NoiseLearner\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime.options import (\n"
"        NoiseLearnerOptions,\n"
"        ResilienceOptionsV2,\n"
"        EstimatorOptions,\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService, EstimatorV2\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime.noise_learner import NoiseLearner\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime.options import (\n"
"        NoiseLearnerOptions,\n"
"        ResilienceOptionsV2,\n"
"        EstimatorOptions,\n"
"    )\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # Build a circuit with two entangling layers\n"
"    num_qubits = 27\n"
"    edges = list(CouplingMap.from_line(num_qubits, bidirectional=False))\n"
"    even_edges = edges[::2]\n"
"    odd_edges = edges[1::2]\n"
msgstr ""
"    # Build a circuit with two entangling layers\n"
"    num_qubits = 27\n"
"    edges = list(CouplingMap.from_line(num_qubits, bidirectional=False))\n"
"    even_edges = edges[::2]\n"
"    odd_edges = edges[1::2]\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    circuit = QuantumCircuit(num_qubits)\n"
"    for pair in even_edges:\n"
"        circuit.cx(pair[0], pair[1])\n"
"    for pair in odd_edges:\n"
"        circuit.cx(pair[0], pair[1])\n"
msgstr ""
"    circuit = QuantumCircuit(num_qubits)\n"
"    for pair in even_edges:\n"
"        circuit.cx(pair[0], pair[1])\n"
"    for pair in odd_edges:\n"
"        circuit.cx(pair[0], pair[1])\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # Choose a backend to run on\n"
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService()\n"
"    backend = service.least_busy()\n"
msgstr ""
"    # Choose a backend to run on\n"
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService()\n"
"    backend = service.least_busy()\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # Transpile the circuit for execution\n"
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(backend=backend, optimization_level=3)\n"
"    circuit_to_learn = pm.run(circuit)\n"
msgstr ""
"    # Transpile the circuit for execution\n"
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(backend=backend, optimization_level=3)\n"
"    circuit_to_learn = pm.run(circuit)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # Instantiate a NoiseLearner object and execute the noise learning program\n"
"    learner = NoiseLearner(mode=backend)\n"
"    job = learner.run([circuit_to_learn])\n"
"    noise_model = job.result()\n"
"    ```\n"
"    The resulting `NoiseLearnerResult.data` is a list of [`LayerError`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-layer-error) objects containing the [noise model](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866) for each individual entangling layer that belongs to the target circuits. Each `LayerError` stores the layer information, in the form of a circuit and a set of qubit labels, alongside the [`PauliLindbladError`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-pauli-lindblad-error) for the noise model that was learned for the given layer.\n"
msgstr ""
"    # Instantiate a NoiseLearner object and execute the noise learning program\n"
"    learner = NoiseLearner(mode=backend)\n"
"    job = learner.run([circuit_to_learn])\n"
"    noise_model = job.result()\n"
"    ```\n"
"    הנתונים `NoiseLearnerResult.data` המתקבלים הם רשימה של אובייקטים מסוג [`LayerError`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-layer-error) המכילים את [מודל הרעש](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866) עבור כל שכבת שזירה בודדת השייכת ל-Circuits המטרה. כל `LayerError` שומר את פרטי השכבה בצורת Circuit וסט תוויות qubit, לצד ה-[`PauliLindbladError`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-pauli-lindblad-error) של מודל הרעש שנלמד עבור השכבה הנתונה.\n"

